  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>Low-top lifestyle sneakers with Air-cushioned comfort\nTextile upper keeps things fresh and breathable\nSleek Nike and Air Max branding adds signature style\nLace closure secures a snug and comfortable fit\nMax Air unit in the heel provides lightweight cushioning\nRubber Waffle outsole offers durable traction and heritage style\nThe Nike Air Max Bia Casual Shoes are imported.\nComfort meets form with a splash of iconic Air Max style on the Men's Nike Air Max Bia Casual Shoes. A light mesh upper with sleek Nike Air Max visuals equips a fresh everyday look, while a visible Max Air unit cushions each step with plush, walking-on-air comfort for fashion-meets-function that stands out from the crowd.</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's Nike Air Max Bia Casual Shoes</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Sizing Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Adult</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/White</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>3488058</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; curso